       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "Likevel mener jeg at romanen er anbefalingsverdig for målgruppen.",
       "alumno": "Even so, I think the novel is recommendable for that audience.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
