    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Expressing a nuanced evaluation",
     "texto": [
      "**Helhetsinntrykk** sums up the overall impression. **Et forbehold** is a reservation or caution.",
      "In a review you can highlight a quality and mention a limitation without presenting the work as perfect or useless."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Recommending precisely",
     "texto": [
      "**Engasjerende** means it keeps your interest; **ujevn**, that it isn't equally good in all its parts. It explains for whom the work may be suitable."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
